   "text": "Every episode loses most viewers in the opening minutes: E1 opens with 67.1 of every 100 watching near the start but only 11.9 remain at the 2% mark, and E1's biggest exit came around 6% of the way in, about 7 minutes, losing 7.9 of every 100.",
